    "appearance": "Lolly is a blue-gray tabby with a big round head and no visible nose — black ears, stripes along arms, tail, head sides, back, and top, softened to dark gray in New Horizons. Pink and light pink fill her inner ears; white tips her paws and a circular white muzzle. Her mouth forms a tiny three; eyes echo the number six, flipping to nines when she looks up toward the sky above her.",
    "personality": "Lolly's normal sweetness runs sensitive — kind, easily hurt by lazy or cranky teasing, devoted to fashion, bugs, fish, and furniture hobbies that keep her gently busy. She welcomes visitors though she may ask you to ignore clutter she alone sees, sharing that worry with other normal neighbors who fuss over tidiness. Peppy and normal villagers get motherly warmth from her; patience and gentle talk earn a loyal, soft-spoken friend who rarely stays angry long.",
